  "definition": "Exemptions; Conditions",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-10-17",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; amd by #10145, eff 6-19-12; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
